  <!-- EN: lead poisoning -->
  <EM_LeadPoisoning.label>铅中毒</EM_LeadPoisoning.label>
  <!-- EN: Contamination in the body caused by exposure to lead. It slowly accumulates through time and cannot be cured easily or using conventional medicine. Lead poisoning happens when a person accidentally ingested or inhaled lead through different means; it can be due to consuming contaminated food or inhaling vapors produced by this metal when melted or used as a chemical additive.\nHigher levels of lead in the bloodstream can cause severe health issues and eventually death. -->
  <EM_LeadPoisoning.description>因接触铅而导致的身体污染。它会随着时间缓慢积累，无法轻易治愈，也无法使用常规药物治愈。铅中毒发生在人们通过各种方式意外摄入或吸入铅时；可能是由于食用受污染的食物，或吸入该金属在熔化或用作化学添加剂时产生的蒸气。\n血液中铅含量过高会导致严重的健康问题，甚至死亡。</EM_LeadPoisoning.description>
